,"x":"Were you at the Cotton Club?"},{"p":90,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"At the Cotton Club."},{"p":90,"b":12,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Well, was Freddy Guy in the band?"},{"p":90,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":90,"b":14,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"The businessman. The manager."},{"p":90,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. Everybody was there then."},{"p":90,"b":16,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Sonny."},{"p":90,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Sonny."},{"p":90,"b":18,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"How did you -- well, you hit it off with Tricky, didn't you?"},{"p":91,"b":0,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":1,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"He was your buddy. Wasn't he?"},{"p":91,"b":2,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":3,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Who else in the band did you hit it off with?"},{"p":91,"b":4,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Freddy. Freddy Jenkins."},{"p":91,"b":5,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Yeah. Freddy Jenkins was a witty little kind of guy, wasn't he?"},{"p":91,"b":6,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":7,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Gay kind of guy."},{"p":91,"b":8,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":91,"b":9,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"What about Artie?"},{"p":91,"b":10,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. He was a fine trumpet player, even though --"},{"p":91,"b":11,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"He was a more sober minded guy, wasn't he?"},{"p":91,"b":12,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":13,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Didn't he become a lawyer, or study for law, or something?"},{"p":91,"b":14,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"I don't know."},{"p":91,"b":15,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Did Arty -- Arty got sick in the band, didn't he?"},{"p":91,"b":16,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":17,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":18,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. He had a brain tumor."},{"p":92,"b":0,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"That was sad, wasn't it?"},{"p":92,"b":1,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. Real sad."},{"p":92,"b":2,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Did you like that pretty tone?"},{"p":92,"b":3,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":92,"b":4,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Duke liked that tone, didn't he?"},{"p":92,"b":5,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":92,"b":6,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"It was soulful."},{"p":92,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. He had a beautiful tone. A beautiful tone. I liked it."},{"p":92,"b":8,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Well, Posey, of course, he was just play acting all the time, wasn't he?"},{"p":92,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. Uh-huh."},{"p":92,"b":10,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Did he do all right in the section?"},{"p":92,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Oh, yeah. It was a good section then."},{"p":92,"b":12,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Yes. So it was a great section, actually."},{"p":92,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":92,"b":14,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Wasn't it?"},{"p":92,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":92,"b":16,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"I mean, those three sounds together, that made a very fine sound, didn't it?"},{"p":92,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. Uh-huh."},{"p":92,"b":18,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Well, there wasn't anybody with Tricky right then, was there? Wasn't Tricky the only one?"},{"p":92,"b":19,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Tricky. Yeah. I think so. Then he added on."}]}